{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112015048503-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112021205\"/><p>女事主送院後證實不治。</p><p>昨日(11日)晚上10時02分，銅鑼灣禮頓道52號一單位姓羅(47歲)女住戶，被其男友發現在上址暈倒。救援人員接報到場，事主昏迷被送往律敦治醫院治理，其後被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T18:22:45.083369+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T17:50:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T15:57:15.192506+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T18:16:09.386408+00:00","content_hash":"54857129eb6f3c6c72c91b2b570e8df89c395b6aed72020e4fa89acadbe70ab4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T18:22:45.083369+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}